  "seed": "Clicking a key opens a popover above it to type that key's value, at Next defaults with no flag changed. A title on the sample recording has Opacity keyed at one second and three. A click on the key at three seconds picks it and opens the popover above it, in the tool bar's glass, reading Opacity 100. 40 typed and Return keys 40 percent there and the canvas draws the title at 40 percent; Undo puts 100 back in one step and Redo brings 40 back. Adding the first key to the pick reads Mixed; 70 typed sets both; Reset puts both at 100. Escape closes it and keeps the keys picked. A point on the open graph opens the same popover, and picking another tool closes it.",
